{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starshapes is a sleek puzzle drawing game where your solutions become beautiful neon-like star constellations. Many puzzles have multiple logic-based solutions, allowing for freedom to experiment with the game mechanics and finding unconventional solutions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzle constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go stargazing and re-imagine the night sky by drawing your own constellations in 3D puzzles with multiple solutions. Experience constellations from new angles in three dimensions as you etch them into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your own path through puzzles and unlock new and interesting rules as you progress. Unwind with \u2018Connect the dots\u2019 style secret levels featuring real-life constellations and star signs. Soak in the beautiful starlight of all the puzzles you\u2019ve completed along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create new constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.poster.avif?t=1764445203\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.webm?t=1764445203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.mp4?t=1764445203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw, Erase and Edit connections between stars to solve the puzzle and create a constellation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag and rotate puzzles in 3D to view them from different angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smooth and elegant animations make learning the gameplay easy and intuitive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stargaze your own way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tailor your experience with accessibility features, such as color-blindness options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Undo, Redo and Reset with convenient shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observe abstract space</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zoom out and view the constellations you have made so far and track your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play puzzles of varying difficulty, ranging from simple connect the dots puzzles to more challenging ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starshapes features over 50 hand-made puzzles and all 88 IAU recognized real-life constellations as bonus puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2386910?t=1764445203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764445203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764445203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764445203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","i